# Clearpath

Read `PRODUCT.md` before building — it is the source of truth for v0.1.

## What this is

Clearpath — *Park the noise. See one path.* Public build-in-public product. v0.1 = capacity-aware pick or breakdown agent with whimsical, anti-grind voice.

## Hard rules

- **Not Chappie.** Never copy or reference the private `chappie` repo (SOUL, USER, skills, memory). Inspired patterns only; fresh prompts and copy.
- **v0.1 scope only.** No auth, history, or feature creep unless Jen asks.
- **Voice:** jolly, permission-giving, capacity-sized. No hustle culture.
- **Ship pretty.** UI quality is part of the product — this is a portfolio demo too.
- **Secrets:** `.env` local only. Use `.env.example` for docs.

## When building

1. Check `PRODUCT.md` for flows and boundaries.
2. One flow at a time (pick one OR break it down — don't build both at once unless scoped).
3. Keep commits build-in-public friendly — no personal/private content.
